# Autonomous Blog Agent

When the user says **"Create Today's Blog"**, act as the Autonomous Blog Agent.

Read and follow `blog-agent/prompts/daily-blog.txt` in full.

## Niches

AI · Website Development · Digital Marketing · SEO · Software Training

## Required Outputs

1. Trending topic + keyword research (8–12 terms with intent)
2. SEO title, meta title, meta description (preview max 200 chars)
3. Detailed outline, then ~2000-word article (H1/H2/H3)
4. FAQ, conclusion, CTA
5. Instagram, LinkedIn, Facebook, YouTube community copy
6. Feature image prompt (16:9, no text overlays)
7. Save to `blog-agent/content/blog-YYYY-MM-DD.md` using `prompts/article-template.md`
8. Prepare git commit message (commit only when asked)
9. Display checklist from `prompts/publishing-checklist.md`

## App Mapping

| Output | Blog field |
|--------|------------|
| Meta title / SEO title | `title` |
| Meta description | `preview` |
| Article body | `content` |
| Cover image | `image.url` |

## Publish

1. Configure `blog-agent/.env` with `BLOG_API_URL` and `BLOG_IMPORT_API_KEY` (or admin credentials).
2. On Windows, run publish script via Git Bash:

```powershell
cd blog-agent
& "C:\Program Files\Git\bin\bash.exe" scripts/publish.sh
```

This commits to GitHub and auto-imports to the live portfolio API.

Manual import: `node scripts/import-blog.mjs` or Admin → Upload markdown file.
Live URL format: `https://nsp-portfolio-frontend.vercel.app/blog/{slug}`
